# 📊 Module 05: KPIs & Success Metrics

---

# 👋 Welcome

Every Customer Success Manager (CSM) at VBS contributes to the success of our customers and the growth of the business.

But how do we know if we are doing a good job?

The answer is **KPIs**.

KPIs help us measure our performance, identify areas for improvement, and ensure we are delivering value to both our customers and the company.

---

# 🎯 Learning Objectives

After completing this module, you will be able to:

- Understand what a KPI is.
- Learn the key KPIs used to measure CSM performance at VBS.
- Understand how your daily work impacts business goals.
- Identify ways to improve your KPI performance.
- Understand how KPIs contribute to customer success and company growth.

